{"seq":2,"slug":"cross-channel-dispatch-frequency-cap","title":"跨渠道触达编排与频控/去重/疲劳抑制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/abandoned-cart-recovery-lifecycle-messaging-orchestration/recovery-journey-orchestration-engine/cross-channel-dispatch-frequency-cap","wordCount":3430,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨渠道触达编排与频控-去重-疲劳抑制\">跨渠道触达编排与频控/去重/疲劳抑制</h1><p>挽回旅程的状态机决定「这一步该不该发」，跨渠道编排决定「从哪条管道发、发几封、和别的旅程撞不撞车」。把 Email、SMS、Push、WhatsApp、App 内消息当成五个独立的定时队列，跨境场景立刻出现三类交叉失败：同一用户 30 分钟内收到三封不同旅程的邮件；短信和邮件在同一分钟各自说「只剩一件」；用户连续两周每天收到推送后卸载 App。这三类都不是单渠道问题，而是<strong>跨渠道共享的调度状态缺失</strong>——预算、去重键、疲劳信号必须在一个全局层里维护。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把-发什么-与-怎么发-解耦\">核心概念：把「发什么」与「怎么发」解耦</h2><p>编排引擎的输入是状态机产出的<strong>发送意图（send intent）</strong>，含画像、旅程实例、步骤、内容槽位与优先级；输出是零到一条<strong>跨渠道调度决策（dispatch decision）</strong>。中间经过四道全局闸门：渠道选择、频控预算、去重、疲劳抑制。它们必须是四个组件而非一个「if 判断」，因为四者的求值频率与失败语义完全不同——渠道选择每次全新求值，频控维护滑动窗口计数，去重依赖内容指纹，疲劳抑制依赖较长的行为历史。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  SI[发送意图&lt;br/&gt;画像 + 旅程实例 + 步骤 + 优先级] --&gt; CS{渠道选择&lt;br/&gt;可达性 ∧ 成本 ∧ 区域合规}&#10;  CS --&gt;|无可达渠道| DROP1[丢弃并记录原因]&#10;  CS --&gt;|选定渠道链| FC{频控预算&lt;br/&gt;令牌桶扣减}&#10;  FC --&gt;|预算不足| HOLD[挂起重排或丢弃]&#10;  FC --&gt;|预算充足| DD{去重判定&lt;br/&gt;内容指纹 ∧ 时间窗}&#10;  DD --&gt;|近重复| DROP2[丢弃为重复]&#10;  DD --&gt;|唯一| FT{疲劳抑制&lt;br/&gt;疲劳分 &lt; 阈值}&#10;  FT --&gt;|超阈| SUPP[写入抑制窗口]&#10;  FT --&gt;|未超阈| SEND[下发到渠道适配器]&#10;  SEND --&gt; ACK[回执与退信回流]&#10;  ACK --&gt; STATE[更新全局计数与疲劳信号]\">flowchart TD\n  SI[发送意图&lt;br/&gt;画像 + 旅程实例 + 步骤 + 优先级] --&gt; CS{渠道选择&lt;br/&gt;可达性 ∧ 成本 ∧ 区域合规}\n  CS --&gt;|无可达渠道| DROP1[丢弃并记录原因]\n  CS --&gt;|选定渠道链| FC{频控预算&lt;br/&gt;令牌桶扣减}\n  FC --&gt;|预算不足| HOLD[挂起重排或丢弃]\n  FC --&gt;|预算充足| DD{去重判定&lt;br/&gt;内容指纹 ∧ 时间窗}\n  DD --&gt;|近重复| DROP2[丢弃为重复]\n  DD --&gt;|唯一| FT{疲劳抑制&lt;br/&gt;疲劳分 &lt; 阈值}\n  FT --&gt;|超阈| SUPP[写入抑制窗口]\n  FT --&gt;|未超阈| SEND[下发到渠道适配器]\n  SEND --&gt; ACK[回执与退信回流]\n  ACK --&gt; STATE[更新全局计数与疲劳信号]</pre><p>管道的关键性质是<strong>顺序不可交换</strong>：频控必须在去重之前扣减（否则被去重掉的消息会白白消耗预算，或反过来重复消息绕过预算），疲劳抑制必须在最后（因为它读的是最贵的行为信号）。每条丢弃都要写入可归因的原因码，否则「挽回量掉了」将无法定位是预算、重复还是抑制造成的。</p>\n<p>五个渠道的成本、合规与疲劳特性差异巨大：Email 边际成本近似为零、疲劳敏感度低；SMS 按条计费且受 TCPA/PECR 与 10DLC 注册约束、疲劳敏感度高；Push 免费但对卸载影响最大；WhatsApp 按模板消息计费、受 24 小时客服窗口与模板审核约束，在巴西、印度、印尼、中东常是主力渠道；App 内消息免费且无外部退订要求。这正是<strong>渠道链必须升序而非并行</strong>的原因：先用低成本、低打扰渠道试探，无响应再升级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"渠道选择与降级链-可达性-区域合规与成本排序\">渠道选择与降级链：可达性、区域合规与成本排序</h2><p>渠道选择的第一问不是「哪个渠道效果最好」，而是「这个画像此刻在哪些渠道上<strong>合法且可达</strong>」。可达性由同意状态决定：欧洲 PECR 要求电子营销同意「知情、自由给出、清晰且具体」且撤回同样简单；美国 TCPA 下营销短信需事先明示同意（prior express written consent）。因此每个渠道的可达性是三态——<code>OPTED_IN</code>、<code>UNKNOWN</code>、<code>OPTOUT</code>——只有 <code>OPTED_IN</code> 允许进入链条，<code>UNKNOWN</code> 在有合法利益或可发送依据（既有客户关系，PECR soft opt-in）时谨慎使用，<code>OPTOUT</code> 永久排除。</p>\n<p>第二问是区域可发送性。跨境引擎必须按<strong>收件人所在国</strong>而非注册国路由：WhatsApp 商业消息在部分国家受限或被暂停，短信在印度、印尼等市场要求本地注册的发送方身份（如印度 DLT 注册）。把发送方身份、模板与目的国做成一张 (country, channel, sender_identity) → allowed 查表，避免代码里散落国别判断。第三问才是成本与效果排序。链条是一个有序列表，每步带 <code>channel</code>、<code>delay</code>、<code>fallback_condition</code>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>渠道</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>升级条件</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Email</td>\n<td>30–60 分钟</td>\n<td>无打开且无下单</td>\n<td>最廉价，默认首发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Push</td>\n<td>+2 小时</td>\n<td>应用已安装且授权推送</td>\n<td>仅移动端画像具备</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>WhatsApp 模板</td>\n<td>+12 小时</td>\n<td>有号码且窗口允许</td>\n<td>高转化跨境渠道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>SMS</td>\n<td>+24 小时</td>\n<td>已同意且购物车价值超阈值</td>\n<td>按条计费，仅高价值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Email 二次</td>\n<td>+72 小时</td>\n<td>仍未转化</td>\n<td>通常承载激励</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>升级条件必须是<strong>可观测信号</strong>（打开、点击、下单、渠道回执），高成本渠道加价值门槛。当某渠道返回硬退信或模板被拒，直接把该渠道从链条永久移除并改走下一档，而不是重试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"频控-跨渠道共享的加权令牌桶\">频控：跨渠道共享的加权令牌桶</h2><p>频次上限最容易被错误实现成「每渠道一个计数器」，结果邮件每天 2 封、短信 1 条、推送 3 条叠加，用户一天被触达 6 次。正确模型是<strong>一个全局令牌桶加按渠道加权的扣减</strong>：桶容量是「一天内允许的加权触碰预算」。令牌桶是成熟的流量整形算法，IETF 的 srTCM/trTCM（RFC 2697 / RFC 2698）把它形式化为支持彩色标记的双速率模型；这里借用其结构而非其 DiffServ 语义。设桶容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>、补充速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>、当前可用令牌 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(t) = \\min\\left(C,\\; B(t_0) + r\\,(t - t_0) - \\sum_i w_i \\cdot n_i(t_0, t)\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是区间内第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 次已发送消息，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是其渠道权重；发送前判定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>channel</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(t) \\ge w_{\\text{channel}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">channel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 允许并扣减，否则丢弃或挂起。权重让昂贵渠道消耗更多预算：Email 为 1、App 内为 0.5、Push 与 WhatsApp 为 2、SMS 为 3——SMS 权重最高，因为它成本高、监管严、打扰最大。</p>\n<p>桶需<strong>按渠道分层</strong>：全局桶之外再加 per-channel 硬上限，因为「一天 8 个 Email」合规但「一天 8 条 SMS」违规且招投诉。分层结构是「全局加权桶 ∧ 各渠道硬上限」，任一超限即拒绝——合取而非析取，因为两者约束的是不同风险。</p>\n<p>窗口语义本身是常见错误来源。滑动窗口比固定日历窗口更贴近「最近 24 小时」，但要存最近事件的精确时间戳；固定窗口实现简单却会出现边界突发——窗口结束前发满、重开后立刻再发满，用户感受到的是两分钟内的双份。工程折中是<strong>滑动窗口计数器</strong>（当前窗口 + 上一窗口的加权和），存储 O(1) 而误差可控。Klaviyo 的 Smart Sending 提供了更粗但有效的近似：订阅者在该时间窗内已收到消息则跳过本次发送，默认 16 小时（来源：Klaviyo Help Center, <code>help.klaviyo.com</code>）。频控还需<strong>优先级抢占</strong>：预算耗尽而队列还有条目时丢弃最低优先级意图而非随机丢弃。交易类消息（订单确认、退款、物流）通常豁免营销频控，但应在疲劳抑制的「总触碰计数」里计入，因为从用户感知上它们一样是通知。</p>\n<h2 id=\"去重-内容指纹-意图去重与跨旅程合并\">去重：内容指纹、意图去重与跨旅程合并</h2><p>去重不是「同一条消息发两次」这么窄，跨渠道编排里至少有四类重复：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>重复类型</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>检测键</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>精确重复</td>\n<td>重试导致同一封发出两次</td>\n<td>幂等键 <code>(profile, journey_run, step)</code></td>\n<td>丢弃第二次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨旅程重复</td>\n<td>两个旅程都发「购物车还在」</td>\n<td>意图指纹 + 时间窗</td>\n<td>保留高优先级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨渠道重复</td>\n<td>WhatsApp 与 Email 同说「限时折扣」</td>\n<td>内容指纹 + 时间窗</td>\n<td>保留先到者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨设备重复</td>\n<td>手机与桌面各弃购一次</td>\n<td>身份合并后 <code>profile_id</code></td>\n<td>合并为一个实例</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>精确重复靠<strong>确定性幂等键</strong>消除。链路是至少一次投递（at-least-once），重试、回执丢失、消费者崩溃都会重放，因此每次下发必须携带由 <code>(profile_id, journey_run_id, step_id)</code> 确定性构造的键，下游 SDK 据此去重。</p>\n<p>跨旅程与跨渠道重复靠<strong>意图指纹</strong>：<code>intent_fingerprint = hash(profile_id, canonical_product_id, intent_class, content_slot, window_bucket)</code>，<code>intent_class</code> 是粗粒度语义（<code>CART_REMINDER</code>、<code>DISCOUNT_OFFER</code>、<code>BACK_IN_STOCK</code>）。指纹相同的意图在时间窗内只允许一条通过，其余记为 <code>DEDUPED</code>。<code>content_slot</code> 规范化是最易出错处：日期、价格、用户名、A/B 变体 ID、UTM 参数每次渲染都不同，若算进指纹则去重形同虚设——正确做法是拆成<strong>稳定槽位</strong>（意图类、商品集合、优惠类型）与<strong>渲染变量</strong>（时间、个性化、追踪），指纹只用稳定槽位。</p>\n<p>跨设备重复依赖上游的<strong>身份合并</strong>（把多个 <code>anonymous_id</code> 与会话拼到一个 <code>customer_id</code>）。编排引擎不能假设身份在旅程全程稳定：用户可能在邮件发出后、短信发出前完成登录合并，两条意图指向同一真人。合并事件到达时应<strong>重算归属</strong>：迁移旧实例到合并后画像，并对合并后画像重跑去重判定。丢弃必须写原因码，否则去重会悄悄吞掉本应发送的消息，而运营只看到「挽回量 unexplained 下滑」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"疲劳抑制-从静态计数到反应式降频\">疲劳抑制：从静态计数到反应式降频</h2><p>频控是<strong>预算约束</strong>（事前设定上限），疲劳抑制是<strong>反应式降频</strong>（按用户反应动态收紧）：频控保护「不超发」，疲劳抑制保护「不过度发那些正在被忽略的」。</p>\n<p>最直接的信号是<strong>忽视率</strong>（ignored / sent）：连续 N 次触达无打开、无点击、无转化。更早的是<strong>负反馈</strong>：退订、投诉（Gmail Postmaster Tools 的 spam rate）、推送权限关闭、App 卸载、渠道拉黑，它们比沉默强得多，应立刻提升疲劳分并触发冷却。一个可用的疲劳分把近期信号按渠道加权聚合并随时间衰减：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>α</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>ignored</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>neg</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>e</mi><mtext>engaged</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>last_send</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(t) = \\max\\left(0,\\; \\alpha\\, n_{\\text{ignored}} + \\beta\\, n_{\\text{neg}} - \\gamma\\, e_{\\text{engaged}} \\right) \\cdot e^{-\\lambda (t - t_{\\text{last\\_send}})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ignored</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">neg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">engaged</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">last_send</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3727em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>ignored</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{\\text{ignored}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ignored</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是连续忽视次数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>neg</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{\\text{neg}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">neg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是负反馈次数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>≫</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta \\gg \\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>，一次投诉比十次沉默更危险），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mtext>engaged</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_{\\text{engaged}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">engaged</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是近期正向参与用于抵消，指数项让用户「休息」一段时间后疲劳分自然下降。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 超阈，把该渠道或该画像整体写入<strong>抑制窗口</strong>（例如 14 天内不发营销推送），窗口结束后从衰减值重新起算。</p>\n<p>三个易忽略的约束：<strong>负反馈必须即时且全局</strong>（用户关掉推送权限那刻，所有排队推送意图都应作废）；<strong>疲劳是全渠道的</strong>（各渠道连续忽视应合并为画像级信号，否则用户陷入「邮件不理、短信不理、推送卸载」的逐渠道消耗）；<strong>新用户冷启动保护</strong>（默认 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 会让系统对最脆弱的新画像发得最猛）。</p>\n<p>监管把疲劳抑制从「体验优化」抬升为「送达合规」。Gmail 与 Yahoo 自 2024 年 2 月起对标称日发 5000 封以上至 Gmail 的发送方提出批量发送方要求：SPF 与 DKIM 对齐、DMARC 策略，营销类消息需支持一键退订（RFC 8058 的 <code>List-Unsubscribe-Post</code>），垃圾邮件投诉率须保持 <strong>0.3% 以下</strong>；不合规发送方自 2024 年 6 月起被限流或拒收（来源：Gmail Postmaster Guidelines / Google Workspace Blog, <code>support.google.com</code>）。持续对疲劳用户发送不仅伤留存，还实质降低整个域的送达率——疲劳抑制因此是送达率工程的一部分，而非营销部门可选的优化项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"观测-让每次丢弃可解释\">观测：让每次丢弃可解释</h2><p>跨渠道编排最大的运维风险是「系统静默地少发了消息而无人知道」。因此四道闸门的每次拒绝都必须产出结构化原因码：<code>NO_REACHABLE_CHANNEL</code>、<code>REGION_BLOCKED</code>、<code>CAP_EXCEEDED</code>、<code>DEDUPED</code>、<code>FATIGUE_SUPPRESSED</code>、<code>HOLD_FOR_QUIET_HOURS</code>。有了原因码，运营才能区分「预算设太紧」与「用户真的疲劳了」这两种完全不同的信号。</p>\n<p>关键指标按「意图漏斗」而非「发送量」组织：意图通过率（<code>sent / intents</code>）反映总体健康度；各原因码占比定位是哪道闸门在卡；渠道升级转化（下一档转化 / 上一档无响应数）判断降级链是否合理；每用户加权周触达对比渠道权重是否失衡；分渠道投诉率（per 10k）与 0.3% 阈值对齐。</p>\n<p>跨渠道编排还让「哪个渠道挽回了这单」变得不平凡：用户可能看了邮件没点，两小时后点了短信下单。把最后一击归给 SMS 会系统性高估昂贵渠道，让预算不断推向 SMS。稳健做法是同时记录<strong>首触归因</strong>与<strong>末触归因</strong>并按渠道链位置校正。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>跨渠道编排是四道独立全局闸门——渠道选择、频控、去重、疲劳抑制——顺序不可交换，频控在去重前扣减，疲劳抑制读最贵信号放最后。</li>\n<li>渠道链按「低成本低打扰 → 高成本高打扰」升序降级，升级条件必须是可观测信号；高成本渠道加价值门槛。</li>\n<li>频控是跨渠道共享的加权令牌桶，全局加权桶与 per-channel 硬上限<strong>合取</strong>；滑动窗口优于固定窗口，滑动窗口计数器是可接受的工程折中。</li>\n<li>去重至少有精确、跨旅程、跨渠道、跨设备四类；内容指纹只应使用稳定槽位，排除时间、个性化与追踪参数。</li>\n<li>疲劳抑制是反应式降频：负反馈权重远高于沉默，需全渠道合并、新用户保守，并与 Gmail/Yahoo 0.3% 投诉率阈值对齐。</li>\n<li>每次丢弃写入结构化原因码，是让「挽回量变化」可归因的唯一手段。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的渠道预算与抑制窗口由 <a href=\"journey-state-machine-exit-conditions\">挽回旅程状态机与进入/退出/冷却条件</a> 中的退出守卫调用；疲劳信号依赖的身份合并细节见同 hub 的<a href=\"../abandonment-detection-event-identity/identity-stitching-cross-device-privacy\">身份拼接与跨设备隐私</a>；渠道链上发哪条内容、给多大优惠由<a href=\"../incentive-content-decision/\">激励与内容决策</a> 决定；跨渠道归因的完整方法见<a href=\"../attribution-measurement-compliance-exp/\">归因、测量与合规实验</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨渠道触达编排与频控/去重/疲劳抑制","id":"跨渠道触达编排与频控-去重-疲劳抑制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把「发什么」与「怎么发」解耦","id":"核心概念-把-发什么-与-怎么发-解耦"},{"level":2,"text":"渠道选择与降级链：可达性、区域合规与成本排序","id":"渠道选择与降级链-可达性-区域合规与成本排序"},{"level":2,"text":"频控：跨渠道共享的加权令牌桶","id":"频控-跨渠道共享的加权令牌桶"},{"level":2,"text":"去重：内容指纹、意图去重与跨旅程合并","id":"去重-内容指纹-意图去重与跨旅程合并"},{"level":2,"text":"疲劳抑制：从静态计数到反应式降频","id":"疲劳抑制-从静态计数到反应式降频"},{"level":2,"text":"观测：让每次丢弃可解释","id":"观测-让每次丢弃可解释"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"挽回旅程状态机与进入/退出/冷却条件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/abandoned-cart-recovery-lifecycle-messaging-orchestration/recovery-journey-orchestration-engine/journey-state-machine-exit-conditions"},"next":{"title":"送达率治理、抑制列表与同意门（异常与合规）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/abandoned-cart-recovery-lifecycle-messaging-orchestration/recovery-journey-orchestration-engine/deliverability-suppression-consent-gate"}}